#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:8
msgid "扩展运行选项"
msgstr "Advanced Runtime Options"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:10
msgid ""
"构建时设置 `-DXGL_ENABLE_ADVANCED_RUNTIME=ON`，安装消费可要求 `COMPONENTS advanced_runtime`。所有 profile 默认关闭。关闭时 "
"`xgl_step_bounded()` 及非空 `config.options` 返回 "
"`XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`。库和消费者必须使用同一生成配置头。`<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` 声明版本为 `5` 的策略描述符。"
msgstr ""
"Build with `-DXGL_ENABLE_ADVANCED_RUNTIME=ON`. Installed consumers can require `COMPONENTS "
"advanced_runtime`. All profiles disable this feature by default. Without it, `xgl_step_bounded()` and "
"operations with a non-null `config.options` return `XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`. Use the same generated "
"configuration header for the library and consumer. `<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` declares version `5` of the "
"policy descriptor."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:12
msgid "创建与生命周期"
msgstr "Creation and Lifetime"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:32
msgid ""
"检查返回值后，提供 `required.size` 字节并满足 `required.alignment`，再调用 `xgl_init_static()`。也可包含 `<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>`，通过"
" `xgl_init_allocated()` 申请工作区并完成初始化。两种方式读取同一个 `config.options`。"
msgstr ""
"Check the result, provide `required.size` bytes at `required.alignment` and call `xgl_init_static()`. To"
" allocate and initialize in one call, include `<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` and use `xgl_init_allocated()`. Both "
"paths read the same `config.options`."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:34
msgid ""
"配置、options、路由、PHY、provider 与回调上下文都必须持续有效，直到销毁。配置和工作区不能重叠。使用初始化宏填写描述符尺寸、版本和配置尺寸。`xgl_step()` 与 "
"`xgl_step_bounded()` 可以推进同一实例。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the configuration, options, routes, PHY descriptors, provider and callback contexts alive until "
"destruction. Configuration and workspace must not overlap. Use the initializer macro to set the "
"descriptor size, version and configuration size. `xgl_step()` and `xgl_step_bounded()` can advance the "
"same instance."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:33
msgid "期限与观察"
msgstr "Deadlines and Observation"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "选项或事件"
msgstr "Option or event"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "`tx_lifetime_ms`"
msgstr "`tx_lifetime_ms`"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "scope 可靠 TX 忙期上限；零关闭"
msgstr "Scope reliable TX busy-period limit; zero disables it"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "`scope_event_callback`"
msgstr "`scope_event_callback`"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "接收失败及可靠发送排空事件"
msgstr "Receives failure and reliable-drain transitions"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "`XGL_SCOPE_TX_DRAINED`"
msgstr "`XGL_SCOPE_TX_DRAINED`"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "当前 scope 的待确认可靠包已全部确认"
msgstr "All retained reliable TX packets for this scope have drained"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "`XGL_SCOPE_FAILED`"
msgstr "`XGL_SCOPE_FAILED`"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:0
msgid "scope 已终止失败，错误码随事件提供"
msgstr "Terminal scope failure, accompanied by its error"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:43
msgid ""
"非零期限必须小于 `2^31` ms。TX 忙期在第一份可靠工作接纳时开始，持续到最后一个待 ACK 包确认；后续发送、BUSY、重试和部分 ACK 均不延长。到期会清理该 scope "
"拥有的工作并报告超时。持续发送的业务应选择足够的忙期上限，或以显式事务边界停止接纳新工作。"
msgstr ""
"Nonzero intervals must be below `2^31` ms. The TX busy period starts when the first reliable work is "
"admitted and runs until the final reliable packet is acknowledged. Further sends, BUSY, retries and "
"partial ACKs do not extend it. Expiry clears work owned by that scope and reports a timeout. Continuous "
"producers must allow a sufficient busy-period limit or stop admission at explicit transaction "
"boundaries."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:45
msgid "TX 忙期到期的 scope 在新 DATA 交付前终止，不能依靠接收阶段先于维护阶段来延长存活。"
msgstr ""
"A scope with an expired TX busy period terminates before new DATA delivery; receiving before maintenance"
" cannot extend its lifetime."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:47
msgid "普通和原地实际发送均在提交前判定忙期。有效 ACK 完成语义校验后也先判定到期，再应用反馈。纯布局查询只准备缓冲区，实际发送重新判断期限。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary and in-place sends check the busy period before submission. After semantic validation, a valid "
"ACK checks expiry before applying feedback. The layout query prepares buffer space. The actual send "
"checks the deadline again."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:49
msgid ""
"发送排空是协议确认，不能作为远端电机执行、Flash 落盘或业务事务成功的证明。需要业务确认时应另加请求 ID 和业务响应。关闭 peer 是本地生命周期操作；同步通知、远端复位和重试策略由应用决定。"
msgstr ""
"Protocol drain does not prove remote motor execution, Flash persistence or business success. Use a "
"request ID and application response where business confirmation is required. Closing a peer is a local "
"lifecycle operation; remote notification, reset and retry policy belong to the application."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:53
msgid ""
"核心 `config.rx_callback` 接收完整 scope，可返回 BUSY。若乱序包已经进入协议缓存，应用容量恢复后可唤醒 owner "
"再次调度交付。所有回调同步执行，禁止重入同一实例或在回调中销毁实例。"
msgstr ""
"The core `config.rx_callback` receives the full scope and can return BUSY. When out-of-order data is "
"already buffered by the protocol, the application can wake the owner to resume delivery once it has "
"space. All callbacks run synchronously and must not reenter or destroy the instance."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:53
msgid "资源快照"
msgstr "Resource Snapshots"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:55
msgid ""
"`xgl_resources_get()` 返回当前 peer 和失败 peer 数量、待 ACK 包及其载荷字节数、乱序包及其载荷字节数。读取不分配内存，调用方须与实例修改串行化。遍历开销与配置容量有关。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_resources_get()` reports active scopes, failed scopes, retained reliable TX packets and payload "
"bytes, and retained out-of-order RX packets and payload bytes. Reading performs no allocation, requires "
"serialization and costs work proportional to configured capacities."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:59
msgid ""
"在 `<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` 中，`xgl_resources_get()` 描述当前占用，`xgl_memory_report()` 读取同一配置并测量整个工作区的预留。统计中的 "
"`memory_used` 按预留工作区解释。对 RX cache，可显式设 `rx_buffer_size = max_frame_size` 以节省存储。"
msgstr ""
"In `<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>`, `xgl_resources_get()` reports current usage and `xgl_memory_report()` "
"reads the same configuration to measure the entire reservation. The `memory_used` statistic records that"
" reservation. To minimize RX cache storage, set `rx_buffer_size = max_frame_size` explicitly."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:59
msgid "安全 scope 策略"
msgstr "Security Scope Policy"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:61
msgid ""
"有认证能力的 profile 可设 `protect_installed_scopes=true`。它要求合法 provider 和可容纳基本认证帧的协议 MTU。先为 exact `(remote_id, "
"connection_id, epoch)` 安装可信安全会话，再发送数据；该 scope 的 HELLO、DATA、ACK、SACK、RESET、重传及零拷贝布局均采用认证策略。"
msgstr ""
"Profiles with authentication support can set `protect_installed_scopes=true`. It requires a valid "
"provider and a protocol MTU that fits a basic authenticated frame. Install trusted parameters for the "
"exact `(remote_id, connection_id, epoch)` before sending. HELLO, DATA, ACK, SACK, RESET, retries and "
"zero-copy layouts then share this authentication policy."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:63
msgid ""
"关闭后的 scope 不回退为明文。其他未安装 scope 在全局 `auth_required=false` 时仍可使用明文；这不是自动协商或动态信任建立。全局 required "
"继续强制所有本地收发认证。发送预检、原地布局与实际提交按目标的精确 scope 计算帧大小，仅为须认证的帧计入 SECURITY 和 tag。"
msgstr ""
"Closing the scope does not downgrade it to plaintext. Other uninstalled scopes can remain plaintext when"
" global `auth_required=false`; this is neither negotiation nor dynamic trust establishment. Global "
"required mode still protects all local traffic. Send preflight, in-place layout and submission size the "
"frame for the exact target scope. Only frames that require authentication include SECURITY and the tag."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:65
msgid ""
"安装不撤销之前已经接纳的数据；先前缓存的明文仍可在安装后交付。需要新的信任边界时，使用新 epoch/scope 并先安装后接收，显式处置旧 scope "
"的数据。详见[安全生命周期](../reference/protocol/v1/security.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Installation does not revoke previously admitted data; earlier cached plaintext may still be delivered "
"afterward. Use a new epoch/scope and install before receiving when establishing a new trust boundary, "
"and explicitly dispose of old-scope data. See the [security "
"lifecycle](../reference/protocol/v1/security.md)."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:67
msgid "关闭安全会话保留 nonce 域记录；不能无限安装并关闭会话来回收槽。产品负责密钥轮换、epoch、重启新鲜性、真实密码实现及其验证。认证不等于 payload 加密。"
msgstr ""
"Closing a security session retains its nonce-domain record; repeated installation and closure cannot "
"reclaim slots indefinitely. The product owns key rotation, epoch and reboot freshness, the real "
"cryptographic provider and its validation. Authentication does not imply payload encryption."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:69
msgid "调度与验证"
msgstr "Scheduling and Validation"

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:73
msgid ""
"执行预算、pending 和 DMA owner 示例见[有界接收与运行](../explanation/runtime.md)。预算限制工作次数，产品仍需测量完整 WCET。需要执行配额时调用 "
"`xgl_step_bounded()`，因为普通 `xgl_step()` 不限制候选和维护次数。"
msgstr ""
"See [Bounded Receive and Runtime](../explanation/runtime.md) for execution budgets, pending work and a "
"DMA owner example. Budgets cap work counts; measure the complete worst-case execution time in the "
"product. Call `xgl_step_bounded()` when execution quotas matter, because `xgl_step()` leaves candidate "
"and maintenance counts unlimited."

#: docs/zh/guides/advanced-runtime.md:73
msgid "主机 GoogleTest 验证行为；每个 profile 的实际 ELF、栈、DMA cache 一致性、中断延时与产品内存预算需分别验收。测量时构建实际调用扩展 API 的产品固件。"
msgstr ""
"Host GoogleTest verifies behavior. Profile ELFs, stack, DMA cache coherency, interrupt latency and "
"product RAM budgets require separate validation. Measure the firmware with the advanced runtime APIs it "
"uses."
